                <span>12</span>
              </button>
              <button class="action-button action-button--like" aria-label="Like tweet">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="svg-icon" style="width: 16px; height: 16px;">
                  <path d="M20.84 4.61a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-7.78 0L12 5.67l-1.06-1.06a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-7.78 7.78l1.06 1.06L12 21.23l7.78-7.78 1.06-1.06a5.5 5.5 0 0 0 0-7.78z" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
                </svg>
                <span>88</span>
              </button>
              <button class="action-button" aria-label="Share tweet">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="svg-icon" style="width: 16px; height: 16px;">
                  <path d="M4 12v8a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2v-8M16 6l-4-4-4 4M12 2v13" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
                </svg>
              </button>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- Tweet Card 2 (With Frosted Media Card) -->
      <article class="glass-panel tweet-card">
        <div class="tweet-card__inner">
          <div class="tweet-avatar" aria-hidden="true">SD</div>
          <div class="tweet-content">
            <div class="tweet-header">
              <div class="tweet-author">
                <span class="tweet-name">Surface Design</span>
                <span class="tweet-handle">@surfacedesign</span>
                <span class="tweet-time">· 45m</span>
              </div>
              <button class="tweet-more-btn" aria-label="More options">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="svg-icon" style="width: 16px; height: 16px;">
                  <circle cx="5" cy="12" r="1.5"/>
                  <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="1.5"/>
                  <circle cx="19" cy="12" r="1.5"/>
                </svg>
              </button>
            </div>
            <p class="tweet-text">
              The physics of simulated glass refraction combined with backdrop filters creates subtle elegance. Notice how colors from background layers bleed gently into UI elements.
            </p>
            <div class="tweet-media">
              <div class="media-placeholder">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="svg-icon" style="width: 32px; height: 32px; opacity: 0.7;">
                  <rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="2" ry="2"/>
                  <circle cx="8.5" cy="8.5" r="1.5"/>
                  <path d="M21 15l-5-5L5 21"/>
                </svg>
                <span>Refraction Study v2.4</span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="tweet-actions">
              <button class="action-button" aria-label="Reply">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="svg-icon" style="width: 16px; height: 16px;">
                  <path d="M21 11.5a8.38 8.38 0 0 1-.9 3.8 8.5 8.5 0 0 1-7.6 4.7 8.38 8.38 0 0 1-3.8-.9L3 21l1.9-5.7a8.38 8.38 0 0 1-.9-3.8 8.5 8.5 0 0 1 4.7-7.6 8.38 8.38 0 0 1 3.8-.9h.5a8.48 8.48 0 0 1 8 8v.5z" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
                </svg>
                <span>18</span>
              </button>
